ORCA machine settings sept 2026

#------------------
#START
#------------------
PRINT_START BED=[bed_temperature_initial_layer_single] HOTEND=[nozzle_temperature_initial_layer] CHAMBER=[chamber_temperature] EXTRUDER=[initial_no_support_extruder]
SET_PRINT_STATS_INFO TOTAL_LAYER=[total_layer_count]
M83
T[initial_tool]
M140 S[bed_temperature_initial_layer_single]
M104 S[nozzle_temperature_initial_layer]
M141 S[chamber_temperature]
G4 P3000
G1 X108 Y1 F30000
G1 Z1 F600

#------------------
#END
#------------------
SET_PRINT_MAIN_STATUS MAIN_STATUS=print_end
DISABLE_BOX_HEATER
M141 S0
M140 S0
BUFFER_MONITORING ENABLE=0
DISABLE_ALL_SENSOR
G1 E-3 F1800
{if max_layer_z + 3 > max_print_height}
G0 Z{max_print_height} F600
{else}
G0 Z{max_layer_z + 3} F600
{endif}
G1 Y270 F20000
G1 X85 F20000
G1 Y270 F20000
G1 Y287.5 F1500
{if max_layer_z < max_print_height / 2}G1 Z{max_print_height / 2 + 10} F600{else}G1 Z{min(max_print_height, max_layer_z + 3)}{endif}
M104 S0
MY_PRINT_END
G4 P7000
UNLOAD_FILAMENT T=[current_extruder]

#-------------------
#LAYER CHANGE G-CODE
#--------------------
SET_PRINT_STATS_INFO CURRENT_LAYER={layer_num + 1}
SET_CURRENT_LAYER LAYER={layer_num + 1}
_CHECK_LAYER_PAUSE
{if timelapse_type == 1} ; timelapse with wipe tower
G92 E0
G1 E-[retraction_length] F1800
{if layer_z + 0.4 > max_print_height}
G2 Z{max_print_height} I0.86 J0.86 P1 F20000 ; spiral lift a little
{else}
G2 Z{layer_z + 0.4} I0.86 J0.86 P1 F20000 ; spiral lift a little
{endif}
G1 Y235 F20000
G1 X97 F20000
{if layer_z <=25}
G1 Z25
{endif}
G1 Y254 F2000
G92 E0
M400
TIMELAPSE_TAKE_FRAME
G1 E[retraction_length] F300
G1 X85 F2000
G1 X97 F2000
G1 Y220 F2000
{if layer_z <=25}
G1 Z[layer_z]
{endif}
{elsif timelapse_type == 0} ; timelapse without wipe tower
TIMELAPSE_TAKE_FRAME
{endif}
G92 E0

#-----------------------
# CHANGE FILAMENT G-CODE
#-----------------------

{if max_layer_z + 3 > max_print_height}
G0 Z{max_print_height} F1200
{else}
G1 Z{max_layer_z + 3} F1200
{endif}

G1 Y270 F8000
G1 X85 F8000

M106 S0

UNLOAD_FILAMENT T=[current_extruder]

#-------------
# PAUSE G-CODE
#-------------
PAUSE


ORCA PREPARE PAGE.
You must make sure the "Label Objects" and the "Exclude Objects" are checked. 
found at the bottom of the "Others" tab.
Another perhaps useful addition is the "Filename Format" found direcrtly below "Exclude objects"
{filament_settings_id[0]}_ {int((used_filament*100.0))/(100.0)}mtrs_{input_filename_base}.gcode
Which shows what type of filament, how much filament and the print name, when exported into Fluidd
